@ref O 22 r 10(1)(b) (src:3532-3533)
GIVEN `the person objects to a seizure of property or an attachment of a debt by the Sheriff` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a copy is served on the enforcement applicant` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a copy is served on the enforcement respondent, or the enforcement respondent is the objector` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a copy is served on any non-party served with the notice of attachment, or the objector is that non-party, or there is no such non-party` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date the copy of the notice of objection is served` IS A DATE
      `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 22 r 10(1)(b) the objector serves a copy of the notice of objection in time and on the persons the rule names` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the person objects to a seizure of property or an attachment of a debt by the Sheriff`
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where the enforcement respondent or any other person objects (each called in this Rule the objector) to any seizure of property or attachment of a debt by the Sheriff" [where, ruled 2026-11-05 (b)]
        IF NOT (`a copy is served on the enforcement applicant` AND `a copy is served on the enforcement respondent, or the enforcement respondent is the objector` AND `a copy is served on any non-party served with the notice of attachment, or the objector is that non-party, or there is no such non-party`)
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "serve a copy of the notice of objection on the enforcement applicant, the enforcement respondent (if not the objector) and any non‑party served with the notice of attachment (if not the objector)"
        IF `the date the copy of the notice of objection is served` AT MOST `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "within 14 days after the service of the notice of seizure or attachment" [period, ruled 2026-11-05 (a)]

-- The same duty as a regulative rule.  Day 0 of the trace is the service of the notice of seizure or attachment.
DECLARE `o 22 r 10 party` IS ONE OF
    `o 22 r 10 the objector`
    `o 22 r 10 the enforcement applicant`
    `o 22 r 10 the Sheriff`

DECLARE `o 22 r 10 act` IS ONE OF
    `o 22 r 10(1)(a) files a notice of objection with the Sheriff`
    `o 22 r 10(1)(b) serves a copy of the notice of objection on the persons the rule names`
    `o 22 r 10(3) gives notice in writing that the enforcement applicant consents to the release`
    `o 22 r 10(3) releases the specified property or debt`
    `o 22 r 10(4) directs the objector to apply to the Court for an order to release the specified property or debt`
    `o 22 r 10(5)(a) applies by summons in the action supported by affidavit`
    `o 22 r 10(5)(b) serves the summons and supporting affidavit on the persons the rule names`
    `o 22 r 10(5)(c) gives notice in writing to the Sheriff of the case and application number`

-- src:3530 | 10. —(1) Where the enforcement respondent or any other person objects (each called in this Rule the objector) to any seizure of property or attachment of a debt by the Sheriff, the objector must within 14 days after the service of the notice of seizure or attachment — ( a )
-- src:3531 | give notice of such objection to the Sheriff by filing a notice of objection; and
-- src:3532 | ( b )
-- src:3533 | serve a copy of the notice of objection on the enforcement applicant, the enforcement respondent (if not the objector) and any non‑party served with the notice of attachment (if not the objector).
@ref O 22 r 10(1) (src:3530-3533)
`o 22 r 10(1) the duty of the objector` MEANS
    (PARTY `o 22 r 10 the objector`
     MUST `o 22 r 10(1)(a) files a notice of objection with the Sheriff`
     WITHIN 14
     LEST BREACH BY `o 22 r 10 the objector` BECAUSE "the notice of objection was not filed within 14 days after the service of the notice of seizure or attachment")
    RAND
    (PARTY `o 22 r 10 the objector`
     MUST `o 22 r 10(1)(b) serves a copy of the notice of objection on the persons the rule names`
     WITHIN 14
     LEST BREACH BY `o 22 r 10 the objector` BECAUSE "a copy of the notice of objection was not served within 14 days after the service of the notice of seizure or attachment")

