    PARTY `o 22 r 10 the objector` DOES `o 22 r 10(1)(a) files a notice of objection with the Sheriff` AT 14
    PARTY `o 22 r 10 the objector` DOES `o 22 r 10(1)(b) serves a copy of the notice of objection on the persons the rule names` AT 14

#TRACE `o 22 r 10(1) the duty of the objector` AT 0 WITH
